+.Dd September 26, 2026
+.Dt NG_H4 4
+.Os
+.Sh NAME
+.Nm ng_h4
+.Nd Netgraph node type for the Bluetooth H4 UART transport
+.Sh SYNOPSIS
+.In sys/types.h
+.In netgraph/bluetooth/include/ng_h4.h
+.Sh DESCRIPTION
+The
+.Nm h4
+node type turns an open serial port into the transport of a Bluetooth
+controller that speaks the H4 protocol of the
+.Dq UART Transport Layer
+in the Bluetooth Core specification.
+It reassembles the byte stream from the controller into HCI event, ACL
+and SCO packets and passes them to its peer, and writes the packets it
+receives from its peer to the serial port.
+Its single hook is normally connected to the
+.Dq drv
+hook of an
+.Xr ng_hci 4
+node.
+.Pp
+The node attaches to the serial port with
+.Fn ttyhook_register .
+The process that has the port open sends the node an
+.Dv NGM_H4_NODE_SET_TTY
+message carrying its process ID and the file descriptor, and must keep
+the port open for as long as the node is to use it.
+The port must already be configured (speed, flow control) and the
+controller powered and running its firmware; for UART-attached Broadcom
+controllers this is done by
+.Xr bcmbt 4
+and
+.Xr bcmbtattach 8 .
+.Sh HOOKS
+This node type supports the following hook:
+.Bl -tag -width ".Va hook"
+.It Va hook
+Single HCI hook, connected to
+.Xr ng_hci 4 .
+.El
+.Sh CONTROL MESSAGES
+This node type supports the generic control messages, plus the following.
+They have no ASCII form for
+.Xr ngctl 8 ;
+send them in binary with
+.Xr NgSendMsg 3 .
+.Bl -tag -width 3n
+.It Dv NGM_H4_NODE_SET_TTY
+Bind the node to the serial port given as
+.Vt ng_h4_node_set_tty_ep
+.Pq process ID and file descriptor .
+.It Dv NGM_H4_NODE_SET_DEBUG
+Set the debug level
+.Pq Vt ng_h4_node_debug_ep .
+.It Dv NGM_H4_NODE_GET_DEBUG
+Return the debug level.
+.It Dv NGM_H4_NODE_GET_STAT
+Return the packet and byte counters
+.Pq Vt ng_h4_node_stat_ep .
+.It Dv NGM_H4_NODE_RESET_STAT
+Clear the counters.
+.El
+.Sh SHUTDOWN
+This node shuts down upon receipt of an
+.Dv NGM_SHUTDOWN
+control message; it detaches from the serial port.
+.Sh SEE ALSO
+.Xr bcmbt 4 ,
+.Xr netgraph 4 ,
+.Xr ng_hci 4 ,
+.Xr ng_tty 4 ,
+.Xr bcmbtattach 8 ,
+.Xr ngctl 8
+.Sh HISTORY
+An earlier
+.Nm
+node, built on the line discipline interface, was removed in
+.Fx 14.0 .
+This implementation uses the MPSAFE tty hook interface.
+.Sh AUTHORS
+.An Andrey Bodrov Aq Mt ap.bodrov@gmail.com
